  DTS:Description="Publishes the derived customer segments used by marketing and the account teams. Segment assignment combines the RFM deciles, the loyalty tier and the churn band; EU customers without marketing consent are published into a suppressed segment so downstream systems cannot target them, and the previous assignment is retained so segment migration can be reported."
